graph TD
    A["**APPLICATION LAYER**<br>Backtester CLI / Dashboard / API"] --> B["**QUERY LAYER**<br>DataFusion (SQL/DataFrame API)<br>Arrow In-Memory Columnar Format"];
    B --> C["**STORAGE ABSTRACTION LAYER**<br>Artifact Manager (Metadata + Time-Series)<br>* - Metadata: LMDB (heed) for fast lookups*<br>* - Time-Series: Parquet with specialized compression*"];
    C --> D["**COMPRESSION LAYER**<br>* - General: Zstd (seekable via zeekstd)*<br>* - Time-Series: tms/tsink (Gorilla/SIMD)*<br>* - Numeric: pco_store (specialized numeric)*<br>* - Integer: bitpacking (SIMD bit-packing)*"];
    D --> E["**PERSISTENCE LAYER**<br>* - Hot Data: Fjall (LSM-tree) + WAL*<br>* - Cold Data: Parquet files (immutable)*<br>* - Integrity: BLAKE3 (provenance) + XXH3 (validation)*"];
    E --> F["**I/O LAYER**<br>* - Zero-Copy: memmap2 (memory-mapped files)*<br>* - Async I/O: tokio-uring (Linux io_uring)*<br>* - Serialization: rkyv (zero-copy deserialization)*"];

